    [Doc][Model] Add Gemma4 quantized deployment guidance (#18565)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    - documents the public Gemma4 31B dense and 26B-A4B MoE MXFP4
    checkpoints
    - adds TP4DP2 serving examples for 950PR&950DT Products and documents
    the required `--quantization ascend` option
    - uses ModelScope model IDs directly in the quantized deployment
    commands
    - replaces the instruction to contact Huawei engineers with the official
    prebuilt-image workflow
    - adds a multimodal Chat Completions request for functional verification
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No. This is a documentation-only update.
    
